# images/.gitignore
#
# This folder holds the gwizard test media, maintained in the gramps_devutil
# repo and copied into feature repos (or regenerated there by
# make_gwizard_testdata_images.py).  In a feature repo the copies must stay
# out of that repo's history.  In gramps_devutil these files are tracked, so
# listing them here has no effect there.
#
# When you add a test image to gramps_devutil, add its name here too.

# --- this file (copied in from gramps_devutil) -----------------------------
/.gitignore

